673
00:35:42,792 --> 00:35:45,317
THE NIGHT THAT HE WAS KILLED.
YOU LIED TO US.

674
00:35:45,404 --> 00:35:48,711
YOU SAW WHAT HAPPENED TO HIM.
I AM TRYING TO HELP YOU HERE.SHOW ME YOUR HANDS.

675
00:35:48,798 --> 00:35:52,062
NO.SO JANE'S RIGHT.
IT WAS YOU.

676
00:35:52,150 --> 00:35:54,456
NO!OH, FRANK.

677
00:35:54,543 --> 00:35:57,067
FRANK, DON'T MAKE ME KILL YOU,
TOO. NOW YOU TELL ME THE TRUTH.

678
00:35:57,155 --> 00:35:59,766
YOU TELL ME THE TRUTH,
AND I WON'T HURT YOU.

679
00:35:59,853 --> 00:36:02,377
I-I-I-I'M NOT...YOU.

680
00:36:02,464 --> 00:36:04,901
STOP! AAH! STOP! I CONFESS!
I KILLED DAVID!

681
00:36:04,988 --> 00:36:07,165
DON'T LET HIM SHOOT ME!
PLEASE. PLEASE.

682
00:36:07,252 --> 00:36:09,167
TELL THE TRUTH.HE'LL DENY IT LATER.

683
00:36:09,254 --> 00:36:11,995
NO! NO! I-I-I-I BROKE INTO
YOUR GIRLFRIEND'S APARTMENT!

684
00:36:12,082 --> 00:36:15,042
I CUFFED YOU!
I MADE YOU WATCH!

685
00:36:15,129 --> 00:36:17,827
LOOK. SEE?

686
00:36:17,914 --> 00:36:19,220
SEE MY HANDS?

687
00:36:19,307 --> 00:36:21,527
WHERE'S THE GUN?

688
00:36:21,614 --> 00:36:24,617
IN THE STORM DRAIN
OUT FRONT.

689
00:36:24,704 --> 00:36:26,836
IT'S OKAY. I BELIEVE HIM.
I BELIEVE HIM.

690
00:36:26,923 --> 00:36:28,751
RIGSBY.

691
00:36:36,063 --> 00:36:37,412
WAIT.

692
00:36:39,240 --> 00:36:42,243
YOU--YOU KILLED HIM.[Patrick] AH, NOPE.

693
00:36:53,602 --> 00:36:55,691
CHO, HE'S CONFESSED.
YOU WON.

694
00:36:55,778 --> 00:36:57,693
YOU WON.
YOU DON'T HAVE TO HURT HIM.

695
00:36:57,780 --> 00:37:00,566
YOU DON'T HAVE TO HURT HIM.

696
00:37:00,653 --> 00:37:01,915
YOU'RE RIGHT.

697
00:37:02,002 --> 00:37:03,569
IT'S OKAY.

698
00:37:09,444 --> 00:37:11,098
OOH!

699
00:37:14,057 --> 00:37:16,712
[siren wailing in distance]

700
00:37:21,413 --> 00:37:23,806
WE FOUND THE GUN.
BALLISTICS ARE A MATCH.

701
00:37:23,893 --> 00:37:26,809
YOU DIDN'T HIRE DAVID
TO GIVE HIM A SECOND CHANCE.

702
00:37:26,896 --> 00:37:28,594
YOU HIRED HIM
TO STEAL FOR YOU.

703
00:37:28,681 --> 00:37:30,857
HE WAS LIFTING
LAPTOPS AND DATA.

704
00:37:30,944 --> 00:37:34,034
ALL YOU HAD TO DO WAS THREATEN
TO VIOLATE HIS PAROLE.

705
00:37:34,121 --> 00:37:36,079
WHY KILL HIM?
HE WAS STEALING FOR YOU.

706
00:37:36,166 --> 00:37:39,257
HE SAID HE WAS GONNA QUIT.

707
00:37:39,344 --> 00:37:41,824
HE DIDN'T WANT ANY OF IT.

708
00:37:41,911 --> 00:37:44,392
SAID HE JUST WANTED
TO LIVE HIS LIFE.

709
00:37:44,479 --> 00:37:47,787
I THOUGHT HE WAS
GONNA TELL THE COPS.

710
00:37:58,928 --> 00:38:01,975
THE OTHER GUNMAN THAT WAS WITH
YOU WHEN YOU BROKE IN ON ME--

711
00:38:02,062 --> 00:38:05,283
WHO IS HE?

712
00:38:05,370 --> 00:38:07,546
TONY WADE.

713
00:38:07,633 --> 00:38:09,635
HE WORKS FOR ME.

714
00:38:12,681 --> 00:38:14,988
WE'RE DONE HERE.

715
00:38:15,075 --> 00:38:17,338
OKAY.

716
00:38:17,425 --> 00:38:19,035
COME ON.

717
00:38:34,094 --> 00:38:37,489
[door opens and closes]

718
00:38:37,576 --> 00:38:39,534
MR. REED, I APOLOGIZE
FOR ACCUSING YOU

719
00:38:39,621 --> 00:38:42,842
OF SEVERAL CRIMES
I KNEW YOU HAD NOT COMMITTED

720
00:38:42,929 --> 00:38:45,018
AND FOR ASSAULTING YOU
REPEATEDLY.

721
00:38:45,105 --> 00:38:46,498
THAT'S IT?

722
00:38:46,585 --> 00:38:49,022
YES, THAT'S IT.

723
00:38:49,109 --> 00:38:52,373
I THOUGHT THAT WAS
VERY GOOD.

724
00:38:52,460 --> 00:38:53,722
IT'S INCREDIBLE.

725
00:38:53,809 --> 00:38:55,985
ABSOLUTELY INCREDIBLE.

726
00:38:56,072 --> 00:38:58,161
THIS CASE WON'T LAST
30 SECONDS IN A COURT.

727
00:38:58,248 --> 00:39:01,774
THE LAWSUITS, HOWEVER,
WILL LAST FOR A VERY LONG TIME.

728
00:39:01,861 --> 00:39:03,776
COME ON, ADAM.
LET'S GET OUT OF HERE.

729
00:39:03,863 --> 00:39:06,256
AGENT CHO,

730
00:39:06,344 --> 00:39:08,781
YOU'VE MADE
MY CLIENT A RICH MAN.[chuckles]

731
00:39:10,826 --> 00:39:12,350
ONE MORE THING.

732
00:39:12,437 --> 00:39:14,003
WHAT'S THAT?

733
00:39:14,090 --> 00:39:16,266
WE HAVE TESTIMONY
FROM CRYSTAL HARGRAVE

734
00:39:16,354 --> 00:39:19,792
THAT WILL LEAD TO MR. REED BEING
CHARGED WITH SEVERAL FELONIES.

735
00:39:19,879 --> 00:39:21,707
THEY INCLUDE
NARCOTICS TRAFFICKING,

736
00:39:21,794 --> 00:39:23,926
EXTORTION,
SEXUAL HARASSMENT--

737
00:39:24,013 --> 00:39:26,799
NEVER BE ADMITTED.
FRUIT OF THE POISONOUS TREE.

738
00:39:26,886 --> 00:39:30,846
NOT EVEN
FROM THE SAME FOREST.

739
00:39:30,933 --> 00:39:33,414
OUR D.A. IS WILLING
TO TALK A DEAL WITH MR. REED

740
00:39:33,501 --> 00:39:36,330
IN THE INTEREST
OF MENDING FENCES,

741
00:39:36,417 --> 00:39:39,377
IF HE'S INTERESTED
IN MENDING FENCES WITH US.

742
00:39:42,728 --> 00:39:44,686
[speaks indistinctly]

743
00:39:48,734 --> 00:39:50,823
WE'LL SPEAK TO THE D.A.GOOD.

744
00:40:36,651 --> 00:40:40,176
MRS. SEUNG.

745
00:40:40,263 --> 00:40:41,743
MAY I COME IN?

746
00:40:47,357 --> 00:40:48,968
THANK YOU.

747
00:41:01,197 --> 00:41:04,244
WHEN I HEARD
DAVID HAD BEEN KILLED,

748
00:41:04,331 --> 00:41:08,640
I ASSUMED IT WAS
BECAUSE OF THE MISTAKES HE MADE,

749
00:41:08,727 --> 00:41:10,946
BECAUSE HE HADN'T CHANGED
HIS WAYS.

750
00:41:11,033 --> 00:41:13,688
YES?

751
00:41:13,775 --> 00:41:16,256
I WAS WRONG.

752
00:41:19,955 --> 00:41:21,304
YOU WERE RIGHT.

753
00:41:24,090 --> 00:41:26,005
DAVID HAD CHANGED.

754
00:41:28,616 --> 00:41:31,271
DAVID CALLED ME...

755
00:41:33,186 --> 00:41:34,970
TO ASK FOR MY HELP.

756
00:41:37,625 --> 00:41:39,497
BUT I NEVER CALLED HIM BACK.

757
00:41:47,069 --> 00:41:51,465
WHEN I LEARNED
HE'D BEEN KILLED,

758
00:41:51,552 --> 00:41:53,511
I DIDN'T WANT TO ADMIT

759
00:41:53,598 --> 00:41:57,515
THAT MAYBE HE'D
TURNED HIS LIFE AROUND,

760
00:41:57,602 --> 00:41:59,952
BECAUSE THAT WOULD MEAN
ADMITTING THAT I LET HIM DOWN.

761
00:42:02,998 --> 00:42:05,087
[speaking Korean]

